          "message": "Fix setup wizard findings N-6 to N-9\n\n- N-6: wait for the confirmed deletion of probe App A and verify it with\n  GET /app (HTTP 401 or 404) before the wizard deletes the key and App ID.\n  A pending deletion is finished first, also with -Reconfirm.\n- N-7: write setup-state.json with ordinally sorted keys and skip the\n  write when the content is unchanged.\n- N-8: ask about removing an earlier elevation only when one existed.\n  A rejected elevation (HTTP 403) removes nothing; an unclear or\n  interrupted request removes any elevation found.\n- N-9: [l] signs the user out of Azure CLI before az login so cached\n  ARM and Graph access tokens are not reused. Azure 403 errors report\n  the token issue time and whether wids holds Global Administrator.\n\nPart of #32\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>",
